# Email Configuration for Aberash Hotel Booking System
# ======================================================

# Gmail credentials for sending booking confirmation emails
# Generate an App Password at: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
EMAIL_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
EMAIL_PASS=your-app-password-16-chars

# Note: Replace with your actual Gmail address and app password
# The EMAIL_PASS should be a 16-character app-specific password (not your regular Gmail password)
